      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.01,
      "end_seconds": 4.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "So, good morning. I've just opened your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.49,
      "end_seconds": 9.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "hello thanks for fitting me in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.32,
      "end_seconds": 14.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "doctor, thank you for seeing us"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.29,
      "end_seconds": 17.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 18.81,
      "end_seconds": 22.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "He's been having severe lower back pain, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.34,
      "end_seconds": 27.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.1,
      "end_seconds": 32.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "okay so I've had it since Friday"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.75,
      "end_seconds": 37.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.3,
      "end_seconds": 41.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Right I'd call it moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.75,
      "end_seconds": 45.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "have you had trouble passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.94,
      "end_seconds": 52.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "yes actually. Right with trouble passing urine mild I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.04,
      "end_seconds": 57.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Has there been numbness between your legs too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.64,
      "end_seconds": 62.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Yeah. One week I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.96,
      "end_seconds": 68.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Have you had severe lower back pain before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.62,
      "end_seconds": 80.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "yes something like this happened last winter and it went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.51,
      "end_seconds": 85.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "right, have you had any fever or recent fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.63,
      "end_seconds": 90.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "So, no, no fever or recent fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.5,
      "end_seconds": 94.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.83,
      "end_seconds": 99.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Ah uh no my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.06,
      "end_seconds": 117.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.35,
      "end_seconds": 124.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "um, I had an operation for a hernia last spring"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.88,
      "end_seconds": 131.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.46,
      "end_seconds": 137.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Well, um, I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.78,
      "end_seconds": 141.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.15,
      "end_seconds": 153.9,
      "duration_seconds": 10.75,
      "text": "I have COPD, for five years. I did try to ignore it it for a while. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.52,
      "end_seconds": 162.75,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "okay, I can see COPD in your file as well are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.35,
      "end_seconds": 165.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.73,
      "end_seconds": 169.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 170.7,
      "end_seconds": 178.37,
      "duration_seconds": 7.67,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, it's Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.5,
      "end_seconds": 198.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.82,
      "end_seconds": 204.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.52,
      "end_seconds": 207.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.3,
      "end_seconds": 216.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.45,
      "end_seconds": 219.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.88,
      "end_seconds": 225.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.73,
      "end_seconds": 229.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.46,
      "end_seconds": 235.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.89,
      "end_seconds": 239.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.43,
      "end_seconds": 251.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.08,
      "end_seconds": 277.21,
      "duration_seconds": 8.13,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 14, saturation 99 percent and pressure 111 over 71, temperature 36.6, pulse 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.54,
      "end_seconds": 280.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Is that alright doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.18,
      "end_seconds": 289.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.82,
      "end_seconds": 295.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Now I'm gonna do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.78,
      "end_seconds": 298.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "So, breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.42,
      "end_seconds": 317.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "You have numbness in the saddle area and your leg strength is reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.19,
      "end_seconds": 323.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "That's the the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.22,
      "end_seconds": 342.38,
      "duration_seconds": 12.16,
      "text": "from what you've told me and what I found, this looks most like possible cauda equina syndrome needing an urgent scan. I can't rule out a large disc prolapse yet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.37,
      "end_seconds": 346.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "uh will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.41,
      "end_seconds": 378.5,
      "duration_seconds": 31.09,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like possible cauda equina syndrome needing an urgent scan, but I'd like to confirm i'm sending you for an urgent MRI of the spine because of possible cauda equina you need to go to hospital now for an emergency scan i think the spinal team should see you too keep an eye out, and if the numbness spreads, call us the same day or go to emergency"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.09,
      "end_seconds": 386.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "I'd like you back straight away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.4,
      "end_seconds": 390.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I'll book it on my way out"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.44,
      "end_seconds": 398.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 399.18,
      "end_seconds": 401.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "thank you, doctor, goodbye"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 403.01,
      "end_seconds": 404.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
